{
  "title": "Jewel Toned Crispy Thai Butternut Squash Skewers",
  "description": "A resinous and crispy weeknight Thai dish featuring butternut squash, infused oil, and sugar free friendly ingredients, this recipe is perfect for a quick and delicious dinner",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
  "diet": [
    "sugar free",
    "gluten free"
